 "notes": [
  "Posted 8 July 2001, before Coruscant; the list has no Coruscant-set card, so the format is Premiere - Tatooine.",
  "Starting cards as posted under 'STARTING(8)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, Endor, Endor: Bunker, Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay), Prepared Defenses, Secret Plans, Resistance and Mobilization Points; these count toward the 60. The strategy says to start Imperial Decree instead against EBO.",
  "Posted 'ENDOR', 'ENDORBUNKER', 'ENDORLANDING PLATFORM' and 'ENDORBACKDOOR' dested the Dark pages Endor (Dark), Endor: Bunker (Dark), Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark) and Endor: Back Door (Dark), and 'SULLUST' Sullust (Dark); 'FOREST CLEARING' and 'DARK FOREST' dested the Dark Endor sites Endor: Forest Clearing and Endor: Dark Forest.",
  "Posted 'DARTH VADERDLOTS' dested Darth Vader, Dark Lord Of The Sith; 'DARTH VADER' the Premiere Darth Vader; 'DARTH MAUL' the Tatooine Darth Maul; 'MARA JADE' Mara Jade, The Emperor's Hand.",
  "Posted 'DREADNAUGHT'S x3' dested Dreadnaught-Class Heavy Cruiser; 'TIE INTERCEPTOR'S x5' TIE Interceptor; 'EXECUTOR' the Dagobah Executor; 'SEBULBA'S' (under PODRACER) Sebulba's Podracer.",
  "Posted 'MAUL'S STICK', 'VADER'S STICK' and 'MARA'S STICK' dested Maul's Lightsaber, Vader's Lightsaber and Mara Jade's Lightsaber.",
  "Secret Plans and Resistance are Effects in this era, counted in the 60.",
  "The 'COMBAT VEHICLES(9)' header was mis-read as a card and has been dropped.",
  "Total is 60 as published."
